# Mutation protocol

Before changing Cursor user/project config or Proteus-owned mount files:

1. Snapshot when touching host/user config.
2. State intended behavioral effect.
3. Prefer changing only Proteus-owned paths (see `.proteus/activation.json`).
4. Verify by behavior, not file existence alone.
5. Write a receipt. Rollback on failed postcondition.

Do not silently overwrite pre-existing project `AGENTS.md` or non-`proteus-*` Cursor rules. Ideal-body source changes happen in the Proteus repository via its installer — not by treating this mount as source of truth.
